  "notes": "P-022 section A committed selection rules. Frozen BEFORE any candidate output was inspected. Contains no zids, report ids, topics or text; it is safe in a public repository. Roles with group=replacement are resolved in array order and each one excludes every conversation an earlier replacement role already took ('among remaining' in the spec's large-shape rule); group=stress roles are resolved afterwards WITHOUT exclusion and may reuse a conversation, in which case the manifest discloses the overlap. Every order_by list ends with zid ascending, which is the only tie-break and happens entirely inside the private selection process. A threshold or rank change requires a reviewed config edit and a new bundle version; the resolver never silently picks a smaller case.",
